<span begin="00:21.140" end="00:21.410">bet </span><span begin="00:21.410" end="00:21.500">you </span><span begin="00:21.500" end="00:21.920">kick </span><span begin="00:21.920" end="00:22.370">yourself </span><span begin="00:22.370" end="00:22.520">to </span><span begin="00:22.520" end="00:23.150">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.180" end="00:26.750"><span begin="00:23.180" end="00:23.420">Where </span><span begin="00:23.420" end="00:23.570">I've </span><span begin="00:23.570" end="00:23.840">been </span><span begin="00:23.840" end="00:24.140">since </span><span begin="00:24.140" end="00:24.230">you </span><span begin="00:24.230" end="00:24.500">let </span><span begin="00:24.500" end="00:24.860">me </span><span begin="00:24.860" end="00:25.850">go </span><span begin="00:25.850" end="00:25.880">（</span><span begin="00:25.880" end="00:26.570">yeah</span><span begin="00:26.570" end="00:26.750">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.750" end="00:31.970"><span begin="00:26.750" end="00:28.760">Now </span><span begin="00:28.760" end="00:28.940">you </span><span begin="00:28.940" end="00:29.300">wanna </span><span begin="00:29.300" end="00:29.450">be </span><span begin="00:29.450" end="00:29.720">with </span><span begin="00:29.720" end="00:30.350">me </span><span begin="00:30.350" end="00:30.410">（</span><span begin="00:30.410" end="00:31.700">yeah</span><span begin="00:31.700" end="00:31.970">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.970" end="00:34.250"><span begin="00:31.970" end="00:32.180">But </span><span begin="00:32.180" end="00:32.300">you </span><span begin="00:32.300" end="00:32.720">let </span><span begin="00:32.720" end="00:32.810">your </span><span begin="00:32.810" end="00:33.320">colours </span><span begin="00:33.320" end="00:34.250">show</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.460" end="00:37.940"><span begin="00:34.460" end="00:34.670">And </span><span begin="00:34.670" end="00:34.940">it's </span><span begin="00:34.940" end="00:35.000